	    <li>[1267496] High CVE-2021-4058: Heap buffer overflow in ANGLE.
	      Reported by Abraruddin Khan and Omair on 2021-11-06</li>
	    <li>[1270990] High CVE-2021-4059: Insufficient data validation in
