	<p>Problem:</p>
	<blockquote cite="https://www.fetchmail.info/fetchmail-SA-2021-02.txt">
	  <p>In certain circumstances, fetchmail 6.4.21 and older would
	    not encrypt the session using STARTTLS/STLS, and might not have
