	<p>Node.js reports:</p>
	<blockquote cite="https://nodejs.org/en/blog/vulnerability/april-2021-security-releases/">
	  <h1>OpenSSL - CA certificate check bypass with X509_V_FLAG_X509_STRICT (High) (CVE-2021-3450)</h1>
