	    <li>[1092518] Low CVE-2020-15988: Insufficient policy enforcement
	      in downloads. Reported by Samuel Attard on 2020-06-08</li>
	    <li>[1108351] Low CVE-2020-15989: Uninitialized Use in PDFium.
