	  <p>CVE-2016-3189 - Fix use-after-free in bzip2recover (Jakub Martisko)</p>
	  <p>CVE-2019-12900 - Detect out-of-range nSelectors in corrupted files (Albert Astals Cid).  Found through fuzzing karchive.</p>
	</blockquote>
      </body>
