	<p>Mediawiki reports:</p>
	<blockquote cite="https://lists.wikimedia.org/pipermail/mediawiki-announce/2018-September/000223.html">
	  <p>Security fixes:</p>
	  <p>T169545: $wgRateLimits entry for 'user' overrides 'newbie'.</p>
