      <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
	<p>Apache CouchDB PMC reports:</p>
	<blockquote cite="https://blog.couchdb.org/2018/07/10/cve-2018-8007/">
	  <p>Database Administrator could achieve privilege escalation to
