	  <p>High risk: Image and URL MyCode Persistent XSS</p>
	  <p>Medium risk: Multipage Reflected XSS</p>
	  <p>Low risk: ACP logs XSS</p>
	  <p>Low risk: Arbitrary file deletion via ACP’s Settings</p>
