	  <p>The cPanel Security Team discovered a vulnerability in Passenger
	    that allows users to list the contents of arbitrary files on the
	    system. CVE-2017-16355 has been assigned to this issue.</p>
	</blockquote>
      </body>
    </description>
    <references>
