	  <li><p>CVE-2015-5346 Apache Tomcat Session fixation</p></li>
	  <li><p>CVE-2015-5351 Apache Tomcat CSRF token leak</p></li>
	  <li><p>CVE-2016-0763 Apache Tomcat Security Manager Bypass</p></li>
	  </ul>
	</blockquote>
      </body>
