	<blockquote cite="http://googlechromereleases.blogspot.nl/2015/04/stable-channel-update_14.html">
	  <p>45 new security fixes, including:</p>
	  <ul>
	    <li>[456518] High CVE-2015-1235: Cross-origin-bypass in HTML
