      <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
	<p>Squid developers report:</p>
	<blockquote cite="http://www.squid-cache.org/Advisories/SQUID-2012_1.txt">
	  <p>Due to missing input validation Squid cachemgr.cgi tool
