	  <p>It was possible to conduct a XSS attack using crafted URLs org
	    POST parameters on several pages.</p>
	</blockquote>
      </body>
    </description>
    <references>
      <cvename>CVE-2010-3056</cvename>
      <url>http://www.phpmyadmin.net/home_page/security/PMASA-2010-5.php</url>
