	  <li>Cacti Graph Viewer SQL injection vulnerability</li>
	</ul>
	</blockquote>
      </body>
    </description>
    <references>
      <url>http://php-security.org/2010/05/13/mops-2010-023-cacti-graph-viewer-sql-injection-vulnerability/index.html</url>
