	<p>Secunia reports:</p>
	<blockquote cite="http://secunia.com/advisories/30283">
	  <p>A vulnerability has been reported in Nagios, which can be
	    exploited by malicious people to conduct cross-site scripting
	    attacks.</p>
	</blockquote>
      </body>
    </description>
    <references>
       <bid>29140</bid>
